{
  "description": "Shared cases for the experiments option and the [Agent] Experiment* properties. Mirrored byte-for-byte in Amplitude-AI-Node test/fixtures/experiment-cases.json; the nova OTLP receiver and the warehouse converters use the cases whose levels hold only 'call'. Levels apply least specific first: agent, child (BoundAgent.child / child()), session, call. debug_logs is the number of debug lines logged while resolving the levels. A string value written as {\"$repeat\": c, \"count\": n} is c repeated n times, and one written as {\"$concat\": [...]} is its parts joined.",
  "cases": [
    {
      "name": "one_experiment",
      "levels": {
        "call": [
          {
            "key": "prompt",
            "variant": "v2"
          }
        ]
      },
      "expected": {
        "[Agent] Experiments": [
          "prompt:v2"
        ],
        "[Agent] Experiment Key": "prompt",
        "[Agent] Experiment Variant": "v2",
        "[Agent] Experiment Unit": "agent_session"
      },
      "debug_logs": 0
    },
    {
